      "content": "it's just all so heavy. journaling or art... it feels like putting a band-aid on a broken limb. nothing actually changes the fact that i'm just an outsider in my own life. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the noise and the effort is to just... not be here. to finally have some actual quiet. does that even make sense?",
